        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ian Astbury, George Thorogood, Bill Graham\n- Events: A Gathering of the Tribes\n- Places: California, Wilmington, Delaware\n\nFacts:\n- George Thorogood was born on February 24, 1950, and he is an American musician, singer, and songwriter from Wilmington, Delaware.\n- Ian Robert Astbury was born on 14 May 1962, and he is an English singer and songwriter.\n- A Gathering of the Tribes was a two-day music and culture festival held in California in October 1990.\n- Ian Astbury and promoter Bill Graham organized A Gathering of the Tribes.",
